    <h2 class="ons-u-mt-l">Set up a survey</h2>
    <p>Before you begin configuring a survey you must have prepared the following:</p>
    <h3>Survey forms</h3>
    <p>Survey forms should be configured using Author and stored locally as JSON files on your computer to upload as part of the migration workflow.</p>
    <h3>Reference data</h3>
    <p>Tested and validated reference data CSV files that comply with existing reference datasets in SPP.</p>
    <h3>Validation rules</h3>
    <p>Documented and agreed validation rules that have been approved by business survey teams and Methodology.</p>

